5,"x":0.073752718486225,"w":0.370932731628418,"h":0.013081394847313854,"text":"really mean. I suppose that's why I've got over 300"},{"x":0.073752702712004459,"text":"online friends. In real life, if you fall out with","y":0.49999999997252453,"h":0.013081395246675065,"w":0.32104122161865239},{"x":0.07375271411639471,"y":0.51453488375366863,"w":0.37960952758789063,"text":"a friend, you don't see them any more. Or sometimes","h":0.013103307391730601},{"x":0.073752719260325353,"w":0.32537960052490239,"h":0.011771551528368396,"y":0.53052325594964334,"text":"you decide that you no longer have much in"},{"h":0.01313495755794658,"x":0.073752702707008594,"y":0.54355108879376268,"text":"common. Then you lose touch. You don't have to","w":0.36225597381591801},{"h":0.013081394847313965,"y":0.55813953506180813,"text":"make the decision - Sit just","w":0.20173534393310549,"x":0.075921919248197689},{"h":0.013081394847313965,"x":0.35140998120860317,"text":"naturally.","w":0.078091101646423355,"y":0.55813953491645918},{"w":0.16952383041381835,"text":"REMEMBER BETTER","y":0.60166483015368688,"x":0.036698077592560378,"h":0.011806252014696872},{"y":0.63065326644956254,"w":0.39262470245361325,"h":0.01340033500837523,"x":0.034707167623518768,"text":"Try to learn phrases rather than single words. This will"},{"w":0.39262470245361331,"h":0.013164173218872421,"x":0.032537967609057646,"y":0.64680232585638175,"text":"help you in exam tasks where you have to fill in gaps."},{"w":0.38177871704101562,"text":"Often the missing word will form a fixed phrase with","y":0.66279069782464339,"x":0.03687637293285434,"h":0.011832417754871427},{"y":0.67713567872468328,"text":"other words that appear before and after the gap.","w":0.36876354217529295,"x":0.034707159859569889,"h":0.013400334609014131},{"y":0.69912790714150386,"h":0.011627906530945697,"x":0.036876358208436738,"text":"Complete the sentences with the correct form","w":0.35357917785644533},{"w":0.38177871704101557,"x":0.036876374523598973,"h":